translatedData.subTitle:
Honestly, this morning I was squatting in a client's backyard trimming those bug-eaten red maples, holding my pruning shears, while my mind was all about that damn T5 update in Pixels.
My wife messaged me asking if I’m coming home for dinner tonight. I stared at the withered pixelated leaves in Pixels and then looked at the real dry leaf in my hand. In that moment, I felt completely disoriented, like I was living in a massive, dimensional landscaping project.
@pixels  The most misleading thing about this game is that 'open world social' title. When I first got into this project, I was just a newbie, rolling in the mud with the boys every day.
